UID:gats-personal-rrsp-contribution-deadline-for-last-year@ghayurtax.com
DTSTAMP:20260919T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270301
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270302
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:RRSP contribution deadline for last year's return
DESCRIPTION:Contributions made in the first 60 days of the year can be de
 ducted on the previous year's return (February 29 in a leap year). FHSA 
 contributions do not get the 60-day rule — they must be made by Decemb
 er 31. Who: RRSP contributors. If a due date falls on a Saturday\, Sunda
 y or public holiday\, the CRA treats it as on time if received the next 
 business day. More: https://www.ghayurtax.com/key-dates.html
URL:https://www.ghayurtax.com/key-dates.html
CATEGORIES:GATS
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
TRIGGER:-P7D
DESCRIPTION:One week: RRSP contribution deadline for last year's return
END:VALARM
