DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270101
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:Last day for this year's donations\, FHSA and RESP contributions
DESCRIPTION:Charitable donations\, FHSA contributions (no 60-day extensio
 n) and RESP contributions for this year's grant must be made by December
  31. TFSA contributions can be made any time there is room. Who: Everyon
 e. If a due date falls on a Saturday\, Sunday or public holiday\, the CR
 A treats it as on time if received the next business day. More: https://
 www.ghayurtax.com/key-dates.html
